
  <sn><md>### Pollutant

Environmental pollutants are substances or forms of energy `introduced into` the environment `at rates faster` than they can be dispersed, diluted, or decomposed, causing harm to living organisms and ecological systems. Their nature, types, and distribution are shaped by both human activities and natural processes.

</md></sn>
